OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will be a fresher day
OL,6,Fthan recently. Some cloud in the
OL,7,Fmorning with the small chance of a
OL,8,Flight shower, though sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping for the afternoon, and
OL,10,Fbecoming generally dry. A slight
OL,11,Fnorthwesterly breeze blowing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine end to the day with
OL,14,Fsome sunshine, leaving a mostly clear
OL,15,Fand dry night to come. Feeling rather
OL,16,Fcool compared to recent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,167,160,301,260,100,100
